  "description": "<p>From weekday heroics to weekend escapes, the new RadRunner Plus is a passenger-ready powerhouse. A Safe Shield Battery, passcode protection, and hydraulic disc brakes keep things safe, while 7-speeds, front suspension, and a 350 lb. payload let you tackle more and stress less. Want to go even further? Just add a Range Extender for up to 120 miles of uninterrupted riding.\u00a0</p>\n<p>Range: Up to 55 miles</p>\n<p>Payload: 350 lb. (275 lb. max rider)</p>\n<p>Top speed: Class 2</p>\n<p>Motor: 750W Rear Hub, 70 Nm torque</p>\n<p>UL status: UL Certified to UL 2849 and UL 2271</p>\n<p>Battery type: 13 Ah Safe Shield External Battery</p>\n<div style=\"display: none;\">radrunner, runner, radrunner plus, runner plus, rad runner, rad runner plus, moped, passenger, fun, scooter, fat, fat tire, fat bike, low step, low-step, step thru, step-thru, step through, step-through, urban, cargo, fun, ebike, utility, bike, electric bicycle, entry, premium, upgrade, upgraded</div>"
